# The files the site serves from the release that site/RELEASE pins (site/README.md). One line per file:
#   <SHA-256>  <path on the site>  <name of the release asset>
# The build downloads each asset, stops when its SHA-256 is not the one written here, and never replaces a page.
# site/RELEASE says latest: the build reads this list from the newest published release (its asset site.sha256)
# instead, so there is no line here. A pinned tag in site/RELEASE needs its lines here.
